   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "For some reason I could not get this to post through the Web interface, so I am trying email.\r<br>\r<br>Catarina,\r<br>  We would probably need to see your script to identify the problem.  I was not able to reproduce the result that you described.\r<br>\r<br>\r<br>simulationModel &lt;- &#39;\r<br>  intercept =~ 1*x1 + 1*x2 + 1*x3\r<br>  slope =~ 1*x2 + 2*x3\r<br>  x1 ~~ 1*x1\r<br>  x2 ~~ 1*x2\r<br>  x3 ~~ 1*x3\r<br>  intercept ~ 0*1\r<br>  slope ~ 20*1\r<br>&#39; # end simulationModel\r<br>\r<br>simulationData &lt;- simulateData(simulationModel, meanstructure=TRUE)\r<br>\r<br>summary(simulationData)\r<br>\r<br>&gt; summary(simulationData)\r<br>       x1                x2              x3       \r<br> Min.   :-5.6153   Min.   :14.29   Min.   :32.29  \r<br> 1st Qu.:-1.0870   1st Qu.:18.70   1st Qu.:38.47  \r<br> Median :-0.1138   Median :19.83   Median :40.03  \r<br> Mean   :-0.1023   Mean   :19.89   Mean   :39.96  \r<br> 3rd Qu.: 0.8939   3rd Qu.:21.03   3rd Qu.:41.51  \r<br> Max.   : 3.7172   Max.   :25.12   Max.   :45.79  \r<br>&gt; \r<br>\r<br>As you can see, my means are 0, 20 and 40.\r<br>\r<br>Keith\r<br>------------------------\r<br>Keith A. Markus\r<br>John Jay College of Criminal Justice, CUNY\r<br><a href=\"http://jjcweb.jjay.cuny.edu/kmarkus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://jjcweb.jjay.cuny.edu/kmarkus&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792425467464000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2OCXnmL0f2KG_MflbTjyuz\">http://jjcweb.jjay.cuny.edu/kmarkus</a>\r<br>Frontiers of Test Validity Theory: Measurement, Causation and Meaning.\r<br><a href=\"http://www.routledge.com/books/details/9781841692203/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.routledge.com/books/details/9781841692203/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792425467464000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0wWMgqKwJOWC2CPCcPn6kg\">http://www.routledge.com/books/details/9781841692203/</a>\r<br>\r<br>\r<br>\r<br>